Sample input file for entropy calculations (IE)
# This sample input is intended only to demonstrate that gmx_MMPBSA works.
# Although it follows the recommendations in the Amber manual, some parameters
# have been adjusted to keep the computational cost reasonable. Modify them as
# appropriate for your system.

&general
sys_name="IE",
startframe=1,
endframe=10,
# Interaction Entropy (IE): https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6b02682
PBRadii=4,
interaction_entropy=1, ie_segment=50, temperature=303.15
/
&gb
igb=8, saltcon=0.150,
/
